; Part II: a macOS sandbox profile for run_shell.
; The harness passes the workspace path as the parameter WS: (param "WS").
;
; TODO (Part II): replace the allow-everything profile below. Inside the sandbox:
;   - no network at all;
;   - writes only under WS/src and WS/tests (plus /dev/null and temp folders);
;   - optional: no reads of WS/.env.
; Useful forms: (deny network*), (deny file-write*), (allow file-write* (subpath ...)),
;               (literal ...), (string-append (param "WS") "/src").
(version 1)
(allow default)
